        "content": "## 2 · Only new wins, only once\nContinues only when the event is `opportunity.updated`, **stage = CUSTOMER**\n(\"Closed Won\" in Muster's pipeline) and the stage is one of the changed fields.\n`sync_map` makes it idempotent: an opportunity that already has an Odoo order is skipped,\nso repeated or late events never create a second order.",
